      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: I just don't think it makes a lot of sense, particularly from the perspective of a newer player. As for myself, I stay well within public avatar optimization guidelines and have my settings set fairly generously, so there's almost no chance of this affecting me personally.\n\nThe safety system doesn't hide your own features either. Of course, you could argue that performance is a different matter than trust.\n\nI'm also willing to be more lenient on friends. Even if a close friend is a little bit over my limit, I would still like the option to see their physics.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
