      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: I know, that's why I said it. After doing some more thinking, I don't mind it being the default behavior, since dynamic bones on yourself can still lag you.\n\nHowever, I think the user should at least get some sort of notification that dynamic bone is disabled due to being over the limit. Maybe a small message or icon in the Avatar Stats menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
