      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think separate limits per trust rank would be a good idea, as it would only cause further animosity towards lower ranks.\n\nBeing able to turn off the limiter for friends and/or yourself would be good, though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
